OL,4,BEA adds AI-generated John Motson to FC 
OL,5,B27 video game                          
OL,6,GFootball game EA Sports FC will        
OL,7,Gfeature the digitally recreated voice  
OL,8,Gof the late commentator John Motson,   
OL,9,GElectronic Arts has exclusively told   
OL,10,Gthe BBC.                               
OL,12,FMotson, who died in 2023, was the main 
OL,13,Fcommentator for BBC Sport for decades  
OL,14,F- and performed the same role for the  
OL,15,Fvideo game series during the 90s and   
OL,16,F00s.                                   
OL,18,FIt is the first time the hit series,   
OL,19,Fformerly known as Fifa, has featured a 
OL,20,Fdeceased commentator.                  
